<FeaturesPage
  title="Midweek Mashers · Noah Lee"
  description="How I grew the Melty Blood scene from small and insular into a sustained community, through event series, format design, and tools other organizers now run their own events on."
  eyebrow="Community / FGC"
  headline="Midweek Mashers"
  headlineEmphasis="Online Event Community"
